---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';

const title = `Privacy Policy | ${siteConfig.businessName}`;
const description = 'Plain-language privacy policy explaining how project inquiries and contact information are handled at Staten Island Software.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="section legal-page-section">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <div class="legal-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Privacy Information</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: November 21, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-content card">
        <h2>1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Staten Island Software (operating Jenkins HQ digital products and customer communications) is operated by <strong>Str3am State LLC</strong> (1016 Manor Road, Staten Island, NY 10314; principal engineer {siteConfig.ownerName}). This Privacy Policy explains how Str3am State LLC d/b/a Staten Island Software collects, uses, stores, and safeguards personal information submitted through our website, contact forms, customer support requests, and optional SMS/MMS messaging programs.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information Collected</h2>
        <p>
          When you voluntarily submit an inquiry, purchase a digital product, or opt in to SMS communications on this site, we collect the information you provide:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Your name, email address, optional mobile phone number, and business/organization name.</li>
          <li><strong>Project &amp; Support Details:</strong> Service category, estimated budget, timeline, existing system URL, and your inquiry or support description.</li>
          <li><strong>SMS Consent &amp; Preference Records:</strong> Whether you checked an optional SMS consent box, the campaign scopes you selected (customer service/order updates and/or promotional updates), timestamp, form source URL, disclosure version, and any subsequent STOP/START opt-out or opt-in status changes.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <strong>Notice Regarding Sensitive Credentials:</strong> Never submit passwords, private API tokens, credit card details, or proprietary source code through public web contact forms.
        </p>

        <h2>3. How Your Information Is Used</h2>
        <p>
          We use your information strictly for legitimate business operations and communications you request:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Evaluating project requirements, preparing scopes of work, and delivering software or digital products.</li>
          <li>Providing customer service, order confirmations, fulfillment updates, and appointment reminders.</li>
          <li>Sending optional consent-based promotional or product release updates only when you have explicitly opted in to marketing messages.</li>
          <li>Maintaining auditable consent, opt-out, and compliance records.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Mobile Information &amp; SMS Consent Non-Sharing Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. All the above categories exclude text messaging originator opt-in data and consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          We may transmit message payloads strictly to our telecommunications and hosting infrastructure providers (including SignalWire and Netlify) solely as necessary to deliver requested text messages, process delivery receipts, and honor STOP/HELP compliance requests. SMS opt-in is completely optional and is never a condition of purchasing any product or service.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Your Choices, Opt-Out &amp; Support</h2>
        <p>
          You may opt out of SMS messages at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any message from us, or reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance. You may also manage preferences or request access, correction, or deletion of your data by emailing customer support at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.supportEmail}`}>{siteConfig.supportEmail}</a> or <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>, or via our <a href="/jenkinshq/sms">SMS Opt-In &amp; Support page</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>
          This website intentionally avoids invasive third-party advertising trackers, behavioral profiling scripts, or marketing cookies. There is no Google Analytics or Meta Pixel installed on this site.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Data Retention &amp; Security</h2>
        <p>
          We retain inquiry, order, and consent/opt-out records only as long as needed to deliver services, honor opt-out suppressions, and meet legal or carrier recordkeeping obligations. We implement reasonable technical safeguards including TLS encryption and access-controlled backend storage.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Related Policies &amp; Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For full text messaging disclosures, see our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service &amp; SMS Messaging Terms</a>, <a href="/jenkinshq/terms">Jenkins HQ SMS Terms</a>, and <a href="/jenkinshq/privacy">Jenkins HQ SMS Privacy Policy</a>. For support inquiries, email <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.supportEmail}`}>{siteConfig.supportEmail}</a> or use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page-section {
    padding-top: 4.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .legal-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .legal-content {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-content {
      padding: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
